            <characteristic name="Type" typeId="2f86-c8b4-b3b4-3ff9">Ordnance 1, Barrage, Large Blast (5&quot;), Ignores Cover, Pinning, Shell Shock (2), One Shot, Ponderous Aim</characteristic>
